From: Nehal J Wani <nehaljw.kkd1@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 7 Jun 2026 16:54:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 01/28] Do not inject debug info unnecessarily

Requires humongous amount of disk space for intermediate objects

Co-authored-by: tropicrainforest <tropicrainforest27017@gmail.com>
---
 SConstruct | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/SConstruct b/SConstruct
index fd818ece..3b6afd49 100644
--- a/SConstruct
+++ b/SConstruct
@@ -3060,7 +3060,7 @@ if env.TargetOSIs('posix'):
     env.Append(
         CCFLAGS=[
             "-fasynchronous-unwind-tables",
-            "-g2" if not env.TargetOSIs('emscripten') else "-g",
+#            "-g2" if not env.TargetOSIs('emscripten') else "-g",
             "-Wall",
             "-Wsign-compare",
             "-Wno-unknown-pragmas",
